# accept-only: the registered native fixture enforces this scenario's behavioral contract
# Native generators read owned sources/docs, write only their declared outputs,
# and produce deterministic bytes and structured/row renderings.
# Owned Git history checks committed-unpushed, staged, unstaged and untracked
# paths against an authored exact set, then compares automatic and explicit
# routing from outside that checkout. No second live Git snapshot is an oracle.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=le test fixture ui/le-discovery-answers
